OL,3,AYemeni forces' retreat leaves Houthis
OL,4,Ain control of key area on coast of Red
OL,5,ASea waterway
OL,6,
OL,7,FYemeni pro-government forces backed by
OL,8,FSaudi Arabia have said they are
OL,9,Fwithdrawing from an area overlooking
OL,10,Fthe strategically important Bab
OL,11,Fal-Mandab Strait, leaving it under the
OL,12,Fcontrol of the Iran-backed Houthi
OL,13,Fmovement.
OL,15,FYemen's military said it was
OL,16,Fredeploying troops from the key
OL,17,Fshipping gateway at the southern end of
OL,18,Fthe Red Sea to defend its interim
OL,19,Fcapital, Aden.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
