OL,3,AYemeni forces' retreat leaves Houthis
OL,4,Ain control of key area on coast of Red
OL,5,ASea waterway
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe shift ends a weeks-long offensive
OL,8,Fto try to secure the area near the
OL,9,Fwaterway after the Houthis seized it in
OL,10,Fa surprise offensive in September,
OL,11,Fsqueezing global oil exports and
OL,12,Fprompting thousands to flee.
OL,14,FHouthi-run media reported later on
OL,15,FSunday the group had taken control of
OL,16,Fthe territory. Saudi Arabia has not
OL,17,Fcommented.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
